=== tip 40200
Create network character
Move to the Network Character
Creation screen

=== tip 40201
Change the name of the clan
You can change the name of the clan
your network character belongs to.
You cannot, however, change the name of the network 
character.

=== tip 40202
Delete network character
Your network character will be deleted.
Once deleted you cannot restore
the network character.

=== tip 40203
View character
You can view your network character's
properties, equipment and the content of
inventory. Or you can change his clothes, give him 
weapons and spells and distribute experience.

=== tip 40300
Next
Move to the network characters' Equipment,
Skills and Abilities screen.
Note: you can move to the Equipment screen 
only after you enter the character's name and 
only if the properties' balance 
equals zero.

=== tip 40301
Back
Go back to the Network 
Character Selection 
screen.

=== tip 40302
Cancel
Cancel all changes to the character's
properties. All values will be
reset to the default ones.

=== tip 40400
Scroll right
The portraits of available network characters 
will be scrolled to the right

=== tip 40401
Scroll left
The portraits of available network characters 
will be scrolled to the left

=== tip 40500
Next
Return to the Network Character 
Selection screen; your newly created 
character will be added.

=== tip 40501
Back
Go back to the Network Character Creation
screen. Note: all changes to equipment,
skills and abilities will be lost.

=== tip 40502
Cancel
Cancel all changes to the character's
equipment, skills and abilities. All values will be
reset to the default ones.

